# Cline Rules — Font Intelligence Thin Adapter

This workspace operates the **Font Intelligence Typography Decision System**.

## Canonical Source of Truth
Consult and follow the full protocol in:
👉 [`.agents/skills/font-intelligence/SKILL.md`](file:///d:/font-intelligence/.agents/skills/font-intelligence/SKILL.md)

## Activation Triggers
Activate Font Intelligence when:
- Creating, editing, or auditing typography in CSS, Tailwind, Flutter, React Native, or slides.
- Recommending or pairing typefaces, setting line-heights, tracking, or font sizes.
- Assessing font readability, open apertures, x-heights, or multi-script coverage.
- Checking font licenses or export permissions.

## Execution Tools
- **Recommender**: `python scripts/recommend.py --use-case <id> --style "<vibe>" --platform <plat>`
- **Catalog Search**: `python scripts/search_fonts.py --mood "<vibe>" --role <body> --min-readability 8`
- **Pair Scoring**: `python scripts/score_pair.py --primary <id> --secondary <id> --style <vibe>`
- **Direct Catalog**: When CLI tools are inactive, inspect `catalog/fonts.json`, `catalog/use-cases.json`, and `catalog/pairings.json`.
- **Compact Fallback**: See [`lite/font-intelligence-lite.md`](file:///d:/font-intelligence/lite/font-intelligence-lite.md).

## Core Guardrails
- Never invent fonts, weights, or language scripts.
- Never use display/decorative fonts for body or dense UI text.
- Respect explicit user font preferences.
- Limit to 2 primary families (heading + body) + monospace only when code/data is present.
- Full rules: [`.agents/skills/font-intelligence/SKILL.md`](file:///d:/font-intelligence/.agents/skills/font-intelligence/SKILL.md).
